      "updated": 1783533569691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "to create and start the container \nVdocker run -d -p 9092:9092 --memory=\"2g\" --cpus=\"2\" --name kafka-server apache/kafka:4.2.0\n\n\nto stop the container\ndocker stop kafka-server\n\n\n\nto start it again\ndocker start kafka-server\n\n\nIf you want to check whether it is running\ndocker ps -a\n\n\nIf you want to remove\ndocker rm -f kafka-server\n\n\nConnect to container\ndocker exec -it kafka-server bash",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "to create and start the container \nVdocker run -d -p 9092:9092 --memory=\"2g\" --cpus=\"2\" --name kafka-server apache/kafka:4.2.0\n\n\nto stop the container\ndocker stop kafka-server\n\n\n\nto start it again\ndocker start kafka-server\n\n\nIf you want to check whether it is running\ndocker ps -a\n\n\nIf you want to remove\ndocker rm -f kafka-server\n\n\nConnect to container\ndocker exec -it kafka-server bash",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
