      "updated": 1783533251946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "login as a consumer to receive the data\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-console-consumer.sh --topic obito --from-beginning --bootstrap-server localhost:9092\n\n\nConsumer in group\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-console-consumer.sh --topic obito --from-beginning --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --group my-group --command-property client.id=consumer-1\n\n\nVerify offsets INFO ABOUT HE CONSUMER LIKE HOW MUCH MESSAGES RECEIVED AND HOW MUCH IS NOT RECEIVED\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --describe --group my-group\n\n\n\nLIST OF ALL THE CONSUMER \n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --list\n\n\n\nRest group offset HELPS TO RETREVE THE DATA FROM THE PERTICULAR MESSAGE\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --group my-group --topic quickstart-events --reset-offsets --to-offset 5 --execute\n ",
      "fontSize": 32.26666259765632,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "login as a consumer to receive the data\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-console-consumer.sh --topic obito --from-beginning --bootstrap-server localhost:9092\n\n\nConsumer in group\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-console-consumer.sh --topic obito --from-beginning --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --group my-group --command-property client.id=consumer-1\n\n\nVerify offsets INFO ABOUT HE CONSUMER LIKE HOW MUCH MESSAGES RECEIVED AND HOW MUCH IS NOT RECEIVED\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --describe --group my-group\n\n\n\nLIST OF ALL THE CONSUMER \n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --list\n\n\n\nRest group offset HELPS TO RETREVE THE DATA FROM THE PERTICULAR MESSAGE\n/opt/kafka/bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --group my-group --topic quickstart-events --reset-offsets --to-offset 5 --execute\n ",
